cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use he-checks or its slide list in research, please cite it as below."
title: "he-checks: collapsed Macenko stain vectors and mis-scaled TCGA colorectal slides"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Parrish
    given-names: Russell
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-9781-7995
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/parallaxmetrology/he-checks
keywords: [computational pathology, H&E, stain normalization, Macenko, TCGA, pixel spacing]
abstract: >
  A check for Macenko-style stain-vector estimation that detects the collapse caused
  by an SVD sign ambiguity (H and E vectors returned a fraction of a degree apart),
  with a sign-safe estimator; and a list of 25 TCGA-COAD/READ diagnostic slides
  whose IDC pixel spacing (0.5 um/px) is too fine by roughly 2x.
